    <div class="how-step"><span class="how-n">4</span><h3>Confirm the details</h3><p>Confirm licensing, insurance and timing directly with the business.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="dir-sec sec-alt" style="background:var(--surface)"><div class="wrap dir-faq">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Good to know</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">{{ niche_label }} in {{ city.city }} — questions answered</h2>
  <details><summary>How many {{ niche_label|lower }} companies are listed in {{ city.city }}?</summary><p>{{ city.count }} in {{ city.place }} right now, and more are added as new local businesses join the directory.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Are these {{ city.city }} {{ niche_label|lower }} companies vetted?</summary><p>Listings are drawn from local {{ niche_label|lower }} businesses serving {{ city.place }}. Always confirm licensing, insurance and recent reviews directly with a business before hiring.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How do I contact a {{ niche_label|lower }} company in {{ city.city }}?</summary><p>Open any listing to see the phone number and, where available, email, website and a map — then reach out to the business directly.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is it free to use this directory?</summary><p>Yes. Browsing and contacting {{ niche_label|lower }} companies in {{ city.city }} is completely free.</p></details>
</div></section>
{% if cities|length > 1 %}
<section class="dir-sec"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Nearby</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">{{ niche_label }} companies in other cities</h2>
  <div class="city-grid">{% for c in cities if c.slug != city.slug %}<a class="city-chip" href="/city/{{ c.slug }}"><span>{{ c.place }}</span><span class="n">{{ c.count }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
</div></section>
{% endif %}

{% elif page == 'provider' %}
<section class="pv-head"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">{{ dir_title }}</a> <span>›</span> {% if prov.place %}<a href="/city/{{ prov.place|slug }}">{{ prov.place }}</a> <span>›</span> {% endif %}<span>{{ prov.name }}</span></p>
  <h1>{{ prov.name }}</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-weight:600">{{ niche_label }} company{% if prov.place %} · {{ prov.place }}{% endif %}</p>
  {{ rating(prov) }}
</div></section>
<div class="wrap pv-grid">
  <div class="pv-detail">
    <dl>
      {% if prov.phone %}<dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ prov.phone_link }}">{{ prov.phone }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
      {% if prov.email %}<dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ prov.email }}">{{ prov.email }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
      {% if prov.address_full %}<dt>Address</dt><dd>{{ prov.address_full }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if prov.hours %}<dt>Hours</dt><dd>{{ prov.hours }}</dd>{% endif %}
      {% if prov.years %}<dt>Experience</dt><dd>{{ prov.years }} years in business</dd>{% endif %}
    </dl>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:.4rem 0 .7rem">About {{ prov.name }}</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">{{ prov.name }} is a {{ niche_label|lower }} business{% if prov.place %} serving {{ prov.place }} and the surrounding area{% endif %}{% if prov.years %}, with {{ prov.years }} years in business{% endif %}. This page brings together everything you need to get in touch — the phone number{% if prov.email %}, email{% endif %}{% if prov.address_full %}, address{% endif %}{% if prov.hours %} and opening hours{% endif %} — so you can reach them directly.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">{{ niche_label }} work ranges from small repairs to larger installations, and the right company depends on the job in front of you. Contact {{ prov.name }} to describe what you need, ask any questions and get a written quote before any work begins. There is no fee to use {{ dir_title }} and no middleman — you deal with the business directly.</p>
    {% set plist = prov.services or services %}
    {% if plist %}
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:1.6rem 0 .8rem">Services</h2>
    <div class="svc-list">
      {% for s in plist %}<div class="svc-item"><span class="svc-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.3L19 7"/></svg></span><div><b>{{ s }}</b><span>Ask {{ prov.name }} about {{ s|lower }}{% if prov.place %} in {{ prov.city or prov.place }}{% endif %}.</span></div></div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:1.6rem 0 .8rem">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="dir-faq">
      <details open><summary>How do I contact {{ prov.name }}?</summary><p>{% if prov.phone %}Call {{ prov.phone }}{% if prov.email %} or email {{ prov.email }}{% endif %}.{% else %}Use the contact details listed above.{% endif %}{% if prov.address_full %} You can also find them at {{ prov.address_full }}.{% endif %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>What areas does {{ prov.name }} serve?</summary><p>{{ prov.name }} is based in {{ prov.place or 'the local area' }} and serves {{ prov.city or prov.place or 'the surrounding area' }} and nearby communities. Confirm your address is covered when you get in touch.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What {{ niche_label|lower }} services does {{ prov.name }} offer?</summary><p>{% if plist %}Typical services include {{ plist[:6]|join(', ') }}{% if plist|length > 6 %} and more{% endif %}. {% endif %}Contact {{ prov.name }} to confirm they cover your specific job.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I choose between {{ niche_label|lower }} companies?</summary><p>Compare the services each one offers, their ratings and how close they are, then ask a couple for a written quote before deciding. The related companies below make it easy to line up a few options.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="pv-side">
    {% if prov.phone %}<a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="tel:{{ prov.phone_link }}">Call {{ prov.phone }}</a>{% endif %}
    {% if prov.website %}<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ prov.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit website &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
    {% set mapq = prov.address_full or prov.place %}
    {% if mapq %}<div class="pv-map"><iframe title="Map — {{ prov.name }}" loading="lazy" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q={{ mapq|urlencode }}&t=&z=12&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"></iframe></div>{% endif %}
  </aside>
</div>

{% if related %}
<section class="dir-sec sec-alt" style="background:var(--surface)"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Compare more options</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">More {{ niche_label|lower }} companies{% if prov.place %} near {{ prov.place }}{% endif %}</h2>
  <div class="rel-list">
    {% for rp in related %}{{ rel_card(rp, sponsored_label if rp.slug in sponsored_slugs else '') }}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a class="more" href="/businesses">See all {{ total }} {{ niche_label|lower }} businesses &rarr;</a></p>
</div></section>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

<footer class="dir-ftr"><div class="wrap">
  <div><b>{{ dir_title }}</b><p>{{ dir_title }} is an independent directory. Listings are shown for information only — contact each business directly to confirm services, availability and pricing.</p></div>
  <p class="micro" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">&copy; 2026 {{ dir_title }}</p>
</div></footer>

{% if page in ('home', 'all') and providers %}
<script>
(function(){
  var q=document.getElementById('dirq'), list=document.getElementById('provlist'),
      none=document.getElementById('noresult');
  if(!list) return;
  var cards=[].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.prov-card'));
  function apply(v){
    var toks=(v||'').toLowerCase().split(/[\s,]+/).filter(Boolean), shown=0;
    cards.forEach(function(c){
      var d=c.getAttribute('data-search');
      var hit=toks.every(function(t){ return d.indexOf(t)>-1; });
      c.hidden=!hit; if(hit) shown++;
    });
    if(none) none.hidden=shown>0;
  }
  if(q) q.addEventListener('input', function(){ apply(q.value); });
  // service quick-chips
  [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.svc-chip')).forEach(function(ch){
    ch.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var val=ch.getAttribute('data-q');
      if(q) q.value=val; apply(val);
      document.querySelectorAll('.svc-chip.on').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('on');});
      ch.classList.add('on');
    });
  });
  // hero search form -> build a query from service + city, filter, scroll to listings
  window.dirSearch=function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    var s=document.getElementById('lh-service'), c=document.getElementById('lh-city');
    var terms=[(s&&s.value)||'', (c&&c.value)||''].filter(Boolean);
    var query=terms.join(' ').trim();
    if(q) q.value=query; apply(query);
    var target=document.getElementById('listings');
    if(target) target.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
    return false;
  };
})();
</script>
{% endif %}
</body>
</html>
